Am Encontro das Águas östlich von Manaus treffen der schwarze Rio Negro und der lehmbraune Solimões aufeinander und fliessen kilometerweit nebeneinander her, ohne sich zu mischen – das Wasser unterscheidet sich in Temperatur, Tempo und Schwebstoffen. Die Strecke folgt genau dieser Grenzlinie nach Nordosten: links das dunkle Wasser des Rio Negro, rechts das helle des Solimões, dazwischen Schlieren, wo sich beide langsam vermischen. Am Nordufer Manaus mit Industriehafen, im Süden die Várzea-Wälder von Careiro.", "en": "At the Meeting of the Waters east of Manaus, the black Rio Negro and the clay-brown Solimões converge and flow side by side for kilometres without mixing – the waters differ in temperature, speed and sediment. The course follows exactly this boundary to the north-east: dark Rio Negro water on the left, the pale Solimões on the right, with swirls in between where the two slowly blend. Manaus and its industrial port line the north bank, the várzea forests of Careiro the south."}, "highlights": [{"name": {"de": "Rio Negro", "en": "Rio Negro"}, "side": "links", "note": {"de": "Schwarzwasser", "en": "black water"}}, {"name": {"de": "Solimões", "en": "Solimões"}, "side": "rechts", "note": {"de": "Weisswasser, lehmbraun", "en": "white water, clay brown"}}, {"name": {"de": "Mündung des Solimões", "en": "Mouth of the Solimões"}, "side": "rechts", "note": {"de": "am Start", "en": "at the start"}}, {"name": {"de": "Manaus, Distrito Industrial", "en": "Manaus, industrial district"}, "side": "links", "note": {"de": "Nordufer, rund 2 km entfernt", "en": "north bank, about 2 km away"}}], "minimap": {"image": "minimap.jpg", "bounds_xz": [-1569.01, -1247.02, 916.09, 1238.08]}, "overview": {"image": "overview.jpg", "bounds_xz": [-3557.09, -3235.1, 2904.17, 3226.16]}, "traffic": {"vessels": ["kursschiff", "motorboot", "faehre"], "density": 0.7, "rower_lanes": [{"out_m": -9.0, "back_m": 22.0, "turn_out_m": -16.0, "turn_back_m": 28.0}, {"out_m": -18.0, "back_m": 31.0, "turn